|YKBThe Charlatan Alchemist|000

|000Theme:

|000Charlatan Alchemists are masters of their craft. Using the
|000knowledge and ingredients gained from hundreds of cultures over
|000the centuries, the alchemist can brew a variety of VERY potent
|000potions to give themselves an unfair advantage over their
|000opponents.
|000
|000The alchemist abilities are centered on altering the makeup of
|000either an object or a person's anatomy. Those within the guild
|000who focus on alchemy are not as physically adept as their 
|000Illusionist brethren, but with the additions of their 
|000alterations they can make a formidable foe. Charlatans with
|000this focus will find that their intelligence will have a large
|000impact on the effectiveness of their brews and other tools.
|000
|000Use '|GKBchelp commands|000' for a list of commands.
|000
|000Alchemists can, to a limited extent, use all of the common
|000physical skills. Their focus and training gives them the
|000ability to fine tune the more common alchemist mixtures to 
|000greater potency.
|000
|000An Alchemist may increase his ability in any of these skills:

|CKBStat Potions|000                Brew a potion to increase a perons's
|000                            stats (str, con, dex, int, wis & chr).

|CKBHealing Potions|000             Brew up a simple healing potion.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Stat Potions' skill|000

|CKBDetox Potions|000               Party on! Great for removing the
|000                            unpleasantries of alcohol.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Healing Potions' skill|000

|CKBRegenerative Potions|000        Brew a potion to increase the rate at
|000                            which a person will regain HP & SP.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Detox Potions' skill|000

|CKBAcid Potions|000                Brew up a very toxic mixture which can
|000                            be flung at a target to inflict damage.

|000The Alchemist also can learn these useful potions and tinctures:

|CKBAlter Weapon|000                Change the compounds in a weapon to
|000                            enhance its characteristics.

|CKBAlter Armour|000                Change the compounds of a piece of
|000                            armour to enhance its quality.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Alter Weapon' skill|000

|CKBTattoo|000                      Apply temporary tattoos using a
|000                            bit of quicksilver. They might
|000                            provide an edge in combat.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Alter Armour' skill|000

|CKBElemental Potions|000           Raw forces of nature in a bottle.
|000                            Can be flung at a target to inflict
|000                            great damage.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Acid Potions' skill|000

|CKBPoison Darts|000                Darts dipped in a special tincture
|000                            you can throw at an enemy to slow
|000                            down their attack.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Elemental Potions'|000
|000                            |RKBskill|000

|CKBCook Ash|000                    A very potent powder cooked from
|000                            Acid Potions and the content of an
|000                            ash burner that can give you
|000                            superhuman reflexes.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Poison Darts' skill|000

|CKBFlying Potions|000              Using the proper ingredients, brew
|000                            up a bottle of instant-flight that
|000                            will let you sail in the skies for
|000                            a short time.
|000                            |RKBRequires the 'Cook Ash' skill|000
